Dialogue: 0,0:00:00.00,0:00:02.62,Default,,0,0,0,,You've always spoken of your father as the executioner.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:04.40,0:00:06.26,Default,,0,0,0,,You remember how he punished you.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:07.34,0:00:10.58,Default,,0,0,0,,And to survive, you accepted it as completely normal.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:11.40,0:00:13.06,Default,,0,0,0,,You never knew anything else.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:14.10,0:00:17.16,Default,,0,0,0,,You eased the worst pressure by telling your priest a little.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:17.98,0:00:19.76,Default,,0,0,0,,But not so much that he stepped in.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:22.12,0:00:23.68,Default,,0,0,0,,You told him about your father.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:25.08,0:00:26.78,Default,,0,0,0,,But praised your mother.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:28.70,0:00:30.02,Default,,0,0,0,,That was your world.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:31.54,0:00:33.14,Default,,0,0,0,,And so the priest never stepped in.
